This crate is a Rust port of PostHog's MCP analytics SDK. It is not an
official PostHog product. It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE).

It ports code from two packages in posthog-js
(https://github.com/PostHog/posthog-js):

- @posthog/mcp, Copyright 2020 Posthog / Hiberly, Inc., licensed under the
  Apache License, Version 2.0.
- @posthog/core (the redaction in src/privacy), licensed under the MIT License
  reproduced below.

Portions of both are themselves derived from agentcathq/agentcat-typescript-sdk
(formerly MCPCat/mcpcat-typescript-sdk), licensed under the MIT License
reproduced below.

